        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the present paper, we restrict ourselves to conservative dynamical systems governed by polynomial ODEs. Furthermore, for simplicity and clarity of exposition (similarly to [11]) we will consider the PE condition for the state variable vector.",
